    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the rain no longer travels with the wind, but rushes indoors, it turns into \u201cthe escaping rain\u201d .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why does this strange weather happen?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mushroom, an investigator of curious cases, receives a vague request to investigate a house, but the owner of the house, the carpenter Cielo, seems to have the slightest inkling of it. A weird atmosphere pervades the place, with strange wooden ears everywhere, \u201cThey seem to have popped up recently, probably because it's been raining for too long.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll play as Mushroom, tracking down clues and solving mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mushroom Investigates into Curious Cases: the Escaping Rain</i> is a point-and-click adventure puzzle game developed by slowicrowi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game length: 0.5-2 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to play:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left mouse button: Move/Interact/Confirm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right mouse button: Call out menu/Cancel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3289210/extras/870179e40423d604e442505f43e76e52.poster.avif?t=1744181505\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3289210/extras/870179e40423d604e442505f43e76e52.apng?t=1744181505\" class=\"bb_img\" width=110 height=100 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Imaginative art style</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Fall down the rabbit hole and embark on a fantasy adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3289210/extras/af549656b5109c25c1fe979ed4f4bdbf.avif?t=1744181505\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive clue-collecting experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-You can interact with all objects (but be careful to identify!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3289210/extras/7b171c553acf8f8dab793ce0f9b30c2c.avif?t=1744181505\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Even the most common items seem to have their own personality</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3289210/extras/51f853b40e155b777dc6f162327672e4.avif?t=1744181505\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique puzzles that follow the plot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3289210/extras/014c61f4b8b1dea8d2e320865e788dd0.avif?t=1744181505\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >3 different ends</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3289210/extras/7b32067bbadd3213797849c4f26ce52d.poster.avif?t=1744181505\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3289210/extras/7b32067bbadd3213797849c4f26ce52d.webp?t=1744181505\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=337 /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >3 original music tracks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3289210/extras/887156e8b4d546cdf25f42b951cef54d.poster.avif?t=1744181505\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3289210/extras/887156e8b4d546cdf25f42b951cef54d.webp?t=1744181505\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
